sequenceDiagram
    participant USER as User
    participant JD as JDInputPanel
    participant AN as Analyze API
    participant GN as Generate API
    participant NW as Network API
    participant EM as Email API
    participant TR as Tracker API
    participant LLM as NVIDIA/OpenRouter

    USER->>JD: Paste JD text or URL
    alt URL input
        JD->>JD: POST /api/career/scrape-jd {url}
        JD-->>USER: Auto-fill JD text
    end

    USER->>JD: Click "Analyze Fit"
    JD->>AN: POST /api/career/analyze\n{jobDescription, masterResume, model}
    AN->>LLM: Parse JD → {role, company, requiredSkills, keywords, responsibilities}
    AN->>LLM: Compare resume vs JD\n→ matchingSkills[], missingSkills[], suggestions[]
    AN-->>JD: {parsedJd, fitAnalysis}
    Note over JD: activePanel → "analysis"

    USER->>AN: Review FitAnalysisPanel\nAccept / Edit / Reject suggestions

    USER->>AN: Click "Generate Resume"
    AN->>GN: POST /api/career/generate\n{masterResume, parsedJd, fitAnalysis,\nconfirmedSuggestions, rejectedSuggestions, atsKeywords, model}
    GN->>GN: buildRequirementMapping()\nMap required skills → resume evidence
    GN->>LLM: Generate ATS-optimized .tex resume\n(temperature=0.2, max_tokens=5000)
    LLM-->>GN: LaTeX source
    GN->>GN: Calculate ATS score\nValidate confirmed suggestions appear
    GN-->>AN: {latex, atsScore, keywordsFound}
    Note over AN: activePanel → "resume"

    USER->>NW: Enter company + role → Search Contacts
    NW->>NW: POST /api/career/network\n{company, role, connectors[]}
    NW-->>USER: ContactResult[] {name, title, company, profile_url}

    USER->>NW: Click "Generate Email" for a contact
    NW->>EM: POST /api/career/email\n{contact, purpose, tone, userContext, targetRole}
    EM->>LLM: Draft cold outreach email
    EM-->>NW: {subject, body}

    USER->>TR: Click "Add to Tracker"
    TR->>TR: POST /api/career/tracker\n{type: application, entry}
    Note over TR: Persisted to data/career_sessions/tracker.json